   "body": {
    "en": [
     "If you come to Kanazawa, seafood is definitely something you should try.",
     "This restaurant is affordable, the portions are generous, and the overall satisfaction level is really high. I like it so much that if I were in Kanazawa, I’d happily go every day. I’ve actually gone there for both lunch and dinner on the same day before.",
     "These are the two branches I recommend:"
    ],
    "ja": [
     "金沢に来たら、海鮮はぜひ食べてほしいです。",
     "このお店は手頃で量が多く、満足度がとても高いです。金沢にいたら毎日でも通いたいくらい好きで、実際に同じ日のお昼と夜の両方に行ったこともあります。",
     "おすすめは次の2店舗です。"
    ]
   },
   "subs": [
    {
     "en": "Rinto branch (Kanazawa Station)",
     "ja": "Rinto店（金沢駅）",
     "map": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=%E9%AD%9A%E3%81%8C%E3%81%97%E9%A3%9F%E5%A0%82%20Rinto%E5%BA%97%20%E9%87%91%E6%B2%A2",
     "t": {
      "en": "The access is unbeatable, but the wait can sometimes be around an hour. If you have a Japanese phone number, when you get your queue ticket you can choose the option to wait away from the restaurant, and they’ll automatically call you when your turn is getting close. That makes it easy to wait in a station café or bookstore instead.",
      "ja": "アクセスは抜群ですが、1時間ほど待つこともあります。日本の電話番号があれば、受付のときに「離れて待つ」を選ぶと、順番が近づいたら自動で電話がかかってきます。駅のカフェや本屋で待てるので便利です。"
     }
    },
    {
     "en": "Central Wholesale Market branch",
     "ja": "中央市場店",
     "map": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=%E9%AD%9A%E3%81%8C%E3%81%97%E9%A3%9F%E5%A0%82%20%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4%E5%BA%97%20%E9%87%91%E6%B2%A2",
     "t": {
      "en": "This one is a little farther from the station and requires taking a bus, but personally I recommend it even more. I’ve been several times and never had to wait. It also feels slightly cheaper than the Rinto branch, the portions seem a little larger, and the menu is slightly different.",
      "ja": "駅から少し離れていてバスに乗る必要がありますが、個人的にはこちらがさらにおすすめです。何度か行きましたが、待ったことは一度もありません。Rinto店より少し安く感じ、量も少し多めで、メニューも少し違います。"
     }
    }
   ],
